<launch>
  <arg name="launch_driver" default="true"/>
  <arg name="vehicle_mirror_param_file"/>
  <arg name="pointcloud_container_name" default="pointcloud_container"/>
  <arg name="vehicle_id" default="$(env VEHICLE_ID default)"/>

  <!--
    Deliberately empty.

    The TIERS bag carries the OS0 as sensor_msgs/PointCloud2 already decoded, not
    as vendor packets, so there is no driver to run and nothing to decode. There
    is also no second LiDAR, so there is nothing to concatenate: localization
    subscribes to the bag's topic directly via the input_pointcloud argument, or
    to the restricted copy the FOV filter publishes.

    Autoware's sensing component still includes this file and would fail if it
    were absent, so it exists to be found and do nothing.
  -->
</launch>
